      "text": "Agreed scope: email + WhatsApp announcements. Needs confirmed class/event details at least one day ahead. Next: confirm the announcement schedule and usable mailing lists/accounts. Instagram AND Facebook declined; Slack, list-posting permission and account access unconfirmed. Student/affiliate status unverified.",
